          "end": 6.45,
          "en": "with picking a user location.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.45,
          "end": 8.795,
          "en": "For this, just as I built the image picker for,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.795,
          "end": 11.32,
          "en": "well the image, I'm now going to add a",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.32,
          "end": 13.35,
          "en": "location picker component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.35,
          "end": 16.55,
          "en": "that will handle picking that user location.",
