          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.82,
          "end": 34.393,
          "en": "or by allowing the user to pick a location on a map.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.36,
          "end": 38.46,
          "en": "Now, we will get started with locating the user though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.46,
          "end": 41.95,
          "en": "So here is my location picker component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.95,
          "end": 46.47,
          "en": "which is also exported here like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.47,
          "end": 47.99,
          "en": "And now in this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.99,
          "end": 50.283,
          "en": "we of course always wanna have some JSX code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.23,
          "end": 55.51,
          "en": "Now it's not that different, compared to the image picker,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.51,
          "end": 59.053,
