          "id": 43,
          "start": 131.82,
          "end": 136.82,
          "en": "and the pick on map handler for opening a map",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 138,
          "end": 141.87,
          "en": "and allowing the user to pick a location there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.87,
          "end": 144.17000000000002,
          "en": "And the first button is therefore bound",
